; Top touch: o<millgui_top> call [reach]. One o<millgui_touch> straight
; down (-Z) of at most [reach]; the surface is the contact Z, uncompensated
; (the tip's lowest point by the tool length offset). Reports it as
; z_minus_probed_position / #1009, in the coordinates in effect before any
; offset write, returns it and keeps it in #<_millgui_top>. Ends #3021
; above the surface. No offset is written.
o<millgui_top> sub
#<reach> = #1
o<millgui_touch> call [2] [-1] [#<reach>]
#<surface> = #<_millgui_hit>
#1009 = #<surface>
(DEBUG, EVAL[vcp.getWidget{"z_minus_probed_position"}.setValue{#<surface>}])
#<_millgui_top> = #<surface>
o<millgui_top> endsub [#<surface>]
M2
